OL,3,GNEWSAPM offers support to impacted
OL,4,AKrakow attack families
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 19-year-old man injured
OL,7,Fin a shooting in Krakow is among those
OL,8,Fbeing offered government support.
OL,10,FThe attack, in Poland's second largest
OL,11,Fcity, saw a gunman kill six people and
OL,12,Finjure 15 others in the busy Main
OL,13,FMarket Square on Saturday.
OL,15,FAmong those fatally shot were four
OL,16,FPolish citizens, 32-year-old Scottish
OL,17,Fman James Thomas Campbell and an
OL,18,FAustrian woman, with 19-year-old Harry
OL,19,FMarchant, from York, currently being
OL,20,Ftreated in hospital for a gunshot
OL,21,Fwound.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
