OL,3,GNEWSAPM offers support to impacted
OL,4,AKrakow attack families
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish families impacted by the
OL,7,Fshooting will be supported "in whatever
OL,8,Fway we can", the prime minister told
OL,9,Fthe House of Commons.
